WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:06.040
TWO, THREE ENTRANCES?

00:00:03.638 --> 00:00:07.275
WE’VE GOT TO ANSWER THESE

00:00:06.174 --> 00:00:09.077
QUESTIONS SOONER THAN LATER.

00:00:07.408 --> 00:00:10.745
ANYWAY, EARLIER TODAY, ONE OF

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:12.614
THE STUDENTS INSIDE THE SCHOOL

00:00:10.879 --> 00:00:14.249
WHEN THE SHOOTING STARTED.

00:00:12.747 --> 00:00:15.884
HER NAME IS MEGAN HILL.

00:00:14.382 --> 00:00:16.651
LISTEN TO HER DESCRIBE THIS

00:00:16.017 --> 00:00:18.887
HARROWING SCENE.

00:00:16.785 --> 00:00:21.223
&gt;&gt;  I WAS SITTING IN CLASS, THE

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:23.325
BOTTOM FLOOR OF THE FRESHMAN

00:00:21.356 --> 00:00:25.093
BUILDING.

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:26.128
WE ALL DOVE TO THE SIDE WHERE

00:00:25.227 --> 00:00:27.729
THE WINDOWS WERE.

00:00:26.261 --> 00:00:29.131
OUR TEACHER TOLD US TO GET TO

00:00:27.863 --> 00:00:30.932
THE SIDE CLOSEST TO THE DOOR.

00:00:29.264 --> 00:00:37.072
SO WE RAN BEHIND THE DESK.

00:00:31.066 --> 00:00:39.107
GOOD THING THE DOOR WAS LOCKED.

00:00:37.206 --> 00:00:41.143
I WAS SITTING RIGHT BEHIND THE

00:00:39.241 --> 00:00:44.146
CABINET AND THE BULLET PASSED MY

00:00:41.276 --> 00:00:46.115
EAR GOT A GIRL NEXT TO ME.

00:00:44.279 --> 00:00:47.816
911 WASN’T WORKING ON MY PHONE.

00:00:46.248 --> 00:00:48.784
APPARENTLY THE GUY GOT OUT

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:49.918
THERE, THERE WAS DEAD BODIES IN

00:00:48.917 --> 00:00:53.355
THE HALLWAY.

00:00:50.052 --> 00:00:53.689
PEOPLE WERE KILLED IN THE

00:00:53.489 --> 00:00:55.057
HALLWAY.

00:00:53.822 --> 00:00:56.926
MY SISTER WAS RUNNING.

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:58.594
SHE RAN FROM HIM AND GOT LUCKILY

00:00:57.059 --> 00:01:00.429
INTO A ROOM THAT SHE FOUND OPEN.

00:00:58.727 --> 00:01:01.931
&gt;&gt;  ON THE PHONE RIGHT NOW IS

00:01:00.563 --> 00:01:03.699
THAT STUDENT THAT YOU JUST HEARD

00:01:02.064 --> 00:01:04.767
FROM, MEGAN HILL.

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.768
MEGAN, THANK YOU FOR TAKING THE

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:08.137
TIME TO JOIN US.

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:08.404
YOU’RE A JUNIOR, AS I UNDERSTAND

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:09.672
IT.

00:01:08.537 --> 00:01:11.040
YOU’RE IN A ROOM.

00:01:09.805 --> 00:01:12.108
THIS DOOR IS LOCKED.

00:01:11.173 --> 00:01:13.676
THIS GUY IS SHOOTING.

00:01:12.241 --> 00:01:17.346
TAKE IT FROM THERE.

00:01:13.809 --> 00:01:20.750
WHAT HAPPENED FROM THERE, MEGAN?

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:21.951
&gt;&gt;  AS THE SHOOTER WAS IN THE

00:01:20.883 --> 00:01:23.920
HALLWAY, I’M NOT SURE IF I WAS

00:01:22.085 --> 00:01:25.988
THE FIRST ROOM.

00:01:24.053 --> 00:01:27.590
HE SHOT THROUGH THE GLASS

00:01:26.122 --> 00:01:30.193
WINDOW, DID NOT OPEN OUR DOOR.

00:01:27.724 --> 00:01:31.427
AND HE TURNED THE GUN TOWARD THE

00:01:30.326 --> 00:01:32.862
SIDE OF THE WALL WHERE THE

00:01:31.561 --> 00:01:34.330
STUDENT WAS SITTING.

00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:36.366
HE SHOT FOUR PEOPLE.

00:01:34.464 --> 00:01:38.067
ONE WAS DEAD.

00:01:36.499 --> 00:01:40.770
THERE WERE THREE OTHER INJURED.

00:01:38.201 --> 00:01:42.238
A GIRL WAS SHOT IN HER RIBS.

00:01:40.904 --> 00:01:46.209
I WAS TOLD TO STAY CALM.

00:01:42.372 --> 00:01:48.712
ALL I WANTED TO DO WAS HELP.

00:01:46.342 --> 00:01:50.180
AFTER TEN MINUTES, I FINALLY

00:01:48.845 --> 00:01:51.915
COULDN’T STAND IT ANYMORE.

00:01:50.313 --> 00:01:55.151
I TOOK OFF MY JEAN JACKET.

00:01:52.048 --> 00:01:56.653
I THREW IT OVER THE DESK AND

00:01:55.285 --> 00:01:57.587
TRIED TO HELP SOMEONE IN FRONT

00:01:56.786 --> 00:01:58.889
OF ME.

00:01:57.721 --> 00:01:59.189
EVERYONE WAS TRYING TO STAY

00:01:59.022 --> 00:02:01.191
CALM.

00:01:59.322 --> 00:02:02.759
I FINALLY GOT A HOLD OF MY

00:02:01.324 --> 00:02:03.927
SISTER MACKENZIE.

00:02:02.893 --> 00:02:05.729
SHE WAS IN THE SECOND FLOOR

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.062
BATHROOM, GOT INTO A DOOR

00:02:05.862 --> 00:02:07.230
SAFELY.

00:02:06.196 --> 00:02:09.066
AND THE TEACHER -- THEY’RE NOT

00:02:07.364 --> 00:02:11.635
ALLOWED TO OPEN THE DOORS FOR A

00:02:09.199 --> 00:02:13.904
POLICY ON CODE RED.

00:02:11.768 --> 00:02:14.171
BUT HE LUCKILY DID AND HE SAVED

00:02:14.037 --> 00:02:16.106
HER.

00:02:14.304 --> 00:02:16.473
SHE WAS PUT INTO A ROOM AND

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:18.442
SURVIVED.

00:02:16.607 --> 00:02:21.845
IT’S JUST VERY TRAUMATIZING.

00:02:18.575 --> 00:02:22.212
WE WERE TOLD TO LEAVE THE

00:02:21.979 --> 00:02:23.313
BUILDING.

00:02:22.346 --> 00:02:24.715
HEADS DOWN AND RUN.

00:02:23.447 --> 00:02:26.583
THERE WERE BODIES ON THE FLOOR,

00:02:24.848 --> 00:02:27.985
I’M NOT SURE DEAD OR NOT.

00:02:26.717 --> 00:02:31.388
WE WERE JUST TOLD TO RUN.

00:02:28.118 --> 00:02:32.923
AND HERE’S MY SISTER MACKENZIE.

00:02:31.522 --> 00:02:36.560
&gt;&gt;  HI, THIS IS MACKENZIE.

00:02:33.057 --> 00:02:39.330
&gt;&gt;  YEAH, GO AHEAD, MEGAN.

00:02:36.694 --> 00:02:39.830
&gt;&gt;  HI, THIS IS HER SISTER

00:02:39.463 --> 00:02:43.634
MACKENZIE HILL.

00:02:39.964 --> 00:02:47.304
FIRST OF ALL, I WANT TO SAY I’M

00:02:43.768 --> 00:02:49.974
SO SORRY FOR ALL OF THE VICTIMS

00:02:47.438 --> 00:02:54.545
AND THEIR FAMILIES.

00:02:50.107 --> 00:02:59.050
&gt;&gt;  MEGAN, LET ME -- SO ALL OF

00:02:54.679 --> 00:03:01.052
THE SUDDEN, THE DOOR OF YOUR

00:02:59.183 --> 00:03:03.154
CLASSROOM IS LOCKED.

00:03:01.185 --> 00:03:04.088
AND THE SHOOTER SHOOTS THROUGH

00:03:03.287 --> 00:03:06.858
THE DOOR.

00:03:04.222 --> 00:03:07.225
THEN STICKS HIS GUN INTO THE

00:03:06.991 --> 00:03:08.493
CLASSROOM.

00:03:07.358 --> 00:03:09.994
FOUR PEOPLE GET SHOT RIGHT IN

00:03:08.626 --> 00:03:13.364
FRONT OF YOU.

00:03:10.128 --> 00:03:15.133
ONE PERSON YOU BELIEVE IS --

00:03:13.498 --> 00:03:17.435
DIED, IS INSTANTLY KILLED.

00:03:15.266 --> 00:03:23.475
YOU’RE TRYING TO HELP A FRIEND

00:03:17.568 --> 00:03:23.808
OF YOURS AND PASS OVER YOUR JEAN

00:03:23.608 --> 00:03:25.477
JACKET.

00:03:23.942 --> 00:03:25.777
AND WHAT HAPPENED FROM THAT

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:26.912
POINT?

00:03:25.911 --> 00:03:30.215
I DIDN’T FULLY UNDERSTAND.

00:03:27.045 --> 00:03:32.450
&gt;&gt;  FROM THAT POINT ON, IN ABOUT

00:03:30.348 --> 00:03:34.586
A COUPLE OF MINUTES, THE SWAT

00:03:32.584 --> 00:03:35.554
TEAM AND POLICE BANGED ON OUR

00:03:34.719 --> 00:03:36.354
DOOR.

00:03:35.687 --> 00:03:38.490
WE DUCKED DOWN.

00:03:36.488 --> 00:03:38.790
THEY CAME IN AND ASKED WHO WAS

00:03:38.623 --> 00:03:40.258
HURT.

00:03:38.924 --> 00:03:41.526
WE TOLD THEM THE FOUR PEOPLE

00:03:40.392 --> 00:03:42.661
THAT WERE HURT.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:46.298
THEY GOT THEM OUT OF THE DOOR

00:03:42.794 --> 00:03:47.232
AND THEY ESCORTED US.

00:03:46.431 --> 00:03:50.335
&gt;&gt;  YEAH.

00:03:47.365 --> 00:03:51.103
AND THEN ABOUT TEN MINUTES GO

00:03:50.469 --> 00:03:52.337
BY.

00:03:51.236 --> 00:03:54.539
IN THE INTERIM TEN-MINUTE

00:03:52.471 --> 00:03:55.307
PERIOD, DID HE STAY SHOOTING

00:03:54.673 --> 00:03:56.375
LONG?

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:57.976
HOW LONG WAS HE ACTUALLY

00:03:56.508 --> 00:03:59.077
SHOOTING INTO THE CLASSROOM?

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.913
&gt;&gt;  HE WAS SHOOTING INTO THE

00:03:59.211 --> 00:04:02.281
CLASSROOM NO LONGER THAN A

00:04:01.046 --> 00:04:05.451
COUPLE OF SECONDS.

00:04:02.414 --> 00:04:06.952
HE WAS SHOOTING IN THE HALLWAY

00:04:05.584 --> 00:04:09.221
UP AT THE CEILING AND DUST WAS

00:04:07.086 --> 00:04:10.556
FALLING ONTO US.

00:04:09.355 --> 00:04:12.624
AND THEN HE TURNED HIS GUN TO

00:04:10.689 --> 00:04:12.958
THE RIGHT AND SHOT A COUPLE OF

00:04:12.758 --> 00:04:14.893
PEOPLE.

00:04:13.092 --> 00:04:15.995
&gt;&gt;  AND THEN I GUESS YOU HEARD A

00:04:15.027 --> 00:04:19.665
LOUD BANG AND THAT WAS THE

00:04:16.128 --> 00:04:19.932
POLICE COMING TO RESCUE ALL OF

00:04:19.798 --> 00:04:21.734
YOU?

00:04:20.065 --> 00:04:24.303
&gt;&gt;  YES.

00:04:21.867 --> 00:04:26.205
&gt;&gt;  I CAN’T EVEN IMAGINE WHAT IT

00:04:24.436 --> 00:04:27.573
HAD TO BE LIKE FOR YOU.

00:04:26.338 --> 00:04:28.974
AND YOU HAD YOUR TWIN SISTER WHO

00:04:27.706 --> 00:04:29.942
WAS ON THE FLOOR ABOVE YOU IN

00:04:29.108 --> 00:04:32.378
THE BATHROOM?

00:04:30.076 --> 00:04:33.879
&gt;&gt;  WELL, ACTUALLY, SHE WAS

00:04:32.511 --> 00:04:35.581
ACTUALLY -- SHE’S IN THAT CLASS

00:04:34.013 --> 00:04:37.650
WITH ME.

00:04:35.715 --> 00:04:38.851
IT’S AP PSYCHOLOGY.

00:04:37.783 --> 00:04:40.520
FIVE MINUTES BEFORE THE SHOOTING

00:04:38.985 --> 00:04:42.355
ACTUALLY HAPPENED, SHE ASKED THE

00:04:40.653 --> 00:04:44.557
TEACHER TO GO TO THE RESTROOM.

00:04:42.488 --> 00:04:45.992
THE RESTROOM ON THE FIRST FLOOR

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.593
WAS WALKED, SO SHE WENT UP TO

00:04:46.125 --> 00:04:48.695
THE SECOND FLOOR.

00:04:47.727 --> 00:04:51.898
SHE WAS WITH A FRIEND.

00:04:48.828 --> 00:04:54.267
AND SHE LEFT THE BATHROOM.

00:04:52.031 --> 00:04:55.535
AND SHE SAW THE SHOOTER BUT GOT

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:58.471
INTO A CLASSROOM JUST IN TIME

00:04:55.668 --> 00:04:58.771
FOR THEM TO LET HER INTO THE

00:04:58.605 --> 00:04:59.973
ROOM.

00:04:58.905 --> 00:05:01.374
&gt;&gt;  I UNDERSTAND YOUR SISTER WAS

00:05:00.106 --> 00:05:03.043
THERE.

00:05:01.508 --> 00:05:03.410
SHE WAS IN THE SECOND-FLOOR

00:05:03.176 --> 00:05:04.978
BATHROOM.

00:05:03.543 --> 00:05:06.112
I DON’T KNOW IF SHE CAN HEAR ME.

00:05:05.111 --> 00:05:07.781
BUT YOU HAD AN EXPERIENCE THAT

00:05:06.246 --> 00:05:10.550
YOU WENT UP TO THE BATHROOM.

00:05:07.914 --> 00:05:11.318
YOU BOTH I GUESS ARE IN AP

00:05:10.684 --> 00:05:13.520
PSYCH.

00:05:11.451 --> 00:05:15.522
AND THERE IS A FRESHMAN GIRL

00:05:13.653 --> 00:05:17.257
THAT HAD SEVERE ASTHMA.

00:05:15.655 --> 00:05:19.092
AND TAKE IT FROM THERE.

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:21.695
AND ALL THE TEACHERS HAD LOCKED

00:05:19.226 --> 00:05:23.697
THE DOOR AND YOU GUYS ARE

00:05:21.828 --> 00:05:25.365
RUNNING LITERALLY DOOR TO DOOR

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:26.700
AND THIS POOR GIRL IS OBVIOUSLY

00:05:25.499 --> 00:05:27.400
STRUGGLING, RIGHT?

00:05:26.833 --> 00:05:30.337
&gt;&gt;  CORRECT.

00:05:27.534 --> 00:05:32.973
WHILE I WAS IN THE BATHROOM, I

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:35.475
HEARD 10 TO 15 GUNSHOTS.

00:05:33.106 --> 00:05:37.377
I RAN TO THE NEAREST CLASSROOM.

00:05:35.609 --> 00:05:38.412
I WENT TO THE DOOR AND THE

00:05:37.511 --> 00:05:41.014
TEACHER IN THE CLASSROOM UNDER

00:05:38.545 --> 00:05:43.817
SCHOOL POLICY, THEY WOULD NOT

00:05:41.148 --> 00:05:44.218
LET ME IN BECAUSE OF THIS SCHOOL

00:05:43.951 --> 00:05:46.620
POLICY.

00:05:44.351 --> 00:05:47.488
AND LUCKILY THEY LET ME INSIDE

00:05:46.754 --> 00:05:48.922
THE CLASSROOM.

00:05:47.621 --> 00:05:53.661
I FEEL THAT IF THE TEACHER KNOWS

00:05:49.056 --> 00:05:54.428
IN HIS GUT THAT HE CAN LET YOU

00:05:53.794 --> 00:05:56.797
IN THE CLASSROOM IN THE SCENARIO

00:05:54.561 --> 00:05:58.599
I WAS IN, THEN HE SHOULD DO IT

00:05:56.931 --> 00:06:00.301
BECAUSE IF THAT TEACHER DID NOT

00:05:58.733 --> 00:06:01.102
LET ME IN, I COULD HAVE BEEN

00:06:00.434 --> 00:06:02.503
KILLED TODAY.

00:06:01.235 --> 00:06:03.104
AND I’M VERY GRATEFUL FOR THAT

00:06:02.636 --> 00:06:05.339
TEACHER.

00:06:03.237 --> 00:06:07.341
AND AS I GOT IN THE CLASSROOM,

00:06:05.473 --> 00:06:07.975
THE TEACHER LOCKED THE DOOR

00:06:07.475 --> 00:06:09.944
AFTER ME.

00:06:08.109 --> 00:06:11.379
EVERYONE WAS CRYING, TOO.

00:06:10.077 --> 00:06:12.280
IMMEDIATELY, I CONTACTED MY

00:06:11.512 --> 00:06:14.415
SISTER WHO WAS IN THE CLASSROOM

00:06:12.413 --> 00:06:14.782
ON THE THIRD FLOOR, NOT KNOWING

00:06:14.549 --> 00:06:16.083
ANYTHING.

00:06:14.916 --> 00:06:20.121
SHE DID NOT RESPOND AND I COULD

00:06:16.217 --> 00:06:22.690
NOT BEAR THE FACT OF LOSING MY

00:06:20.254 --> 00:06:23.825
BEST FRIEND.

00:06:22.824 --> 00:06:25.159
AND I HEARD NOTHING ELSE.

00:06:23.958 --> 00:06:25.493
I DID NOT KNOW IF SHE WAS

00:06:25.293 --> 00:06:26.094
INSIDE.

00:06:25.626 --> 00:06:28.663
&gt;&gt;  YEAH.

00:06:26.227 --> 00:06:30.164
I WANT TO SAY THIS TO BOTH YOU

00:06:28.796 --> 00:06:35.770
AND YOUR SISTER, MEGAN.

00:06:30.298 --> 00:06:38.139
BOTH OF YOU SHOWED AMAZING

00:06:35.904 --> 00:06:40.542
TODAY, MEGAN TRYING TO HELP THE

00:06:38.273 --> 00:06:42.177
GIRL NEXT TO HER AND YOU

00:06:40.675 --> 00:06:43.478
OBVIOUSLY HELPING THIS POOR GIRL

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:45.079
THAT HAD THIS ASTHMA ATTACK AS

00:06:43.611 --> 00:06:47.582
SHE’S GOING ON THERE.

00:06:45.213 --> 00:06:48.516
&gt;&gt;  YES, HER INHALER WAS ON THE

00:06:47.716 --> 00:06:50.919
FIRST FLOOR.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:53.188
I WAS TRYING TO CALM HER DOWN.

00:06:51.052 --> 00:06:53.521
&gt;&gt;  WHEN DID YOU ACTUALLY

00:06:53.321 --> 00:06:55.924
REUNITE?

00:06:53.655 --> 00:06:57.259
BECAUSE HOW LONG AFTER WAS IT

00:06:56.057 --> 00:06:57.859
THAT YOU WERE ABLE TO FIND YOUR

00:06:57.392 --> 00:06:59.728
SISTER AGAIN?

00:06:57.993 --> 00:07:01.363
&gt;&gt;  WELL, AFTER I GOT OUT OF THE

00:06:59.861 --> 00:07:03.331
BUILDING, SHE TOLD ME THAT SHE

00:07:01.496 --> 00:07:04.599
GOT OUT AN HOUR BEFORE ME SHE

00:07:03.465 --> 00:07:06.735
WAS BECAUSE SHE WAS ALREADY DOWN

00:07:04.733 --> 00:07:08.570
THE STREET WAITING FOR ME?

00:07:06.868 --> 00:07:09.905
AND I DIDN’T KNOW SHE WAS INSIDE

00:07:08.703 --> 00:07:11.506
BECAUSE I WAS IN MY CLASSROOM

00:07:10.038 --> 00:07:11.807
AND TOLD TO SILENCE MY CELL

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.708
PHONE.

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:15.577
I FINALLY SEE HER.

00:07:12.841 --> 00:07:16.745
AND AS I WALK OUT THE BUILDING,

00:07:15.711 --> 00:07:19.181
I’M SEEING BLOOD AND PEOPLE

00:07:16.879 --> 00:07:21.416
WOUNDED EVERYWHERE.

00:07:19.314 --> 00:07:22.785
AND IT JUST BROKE MY HEART.

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:26.321
I COULDN’T BEAR THE FACT THAT

00:07:22.918 --> 00:07:28.757
SOMEONE COULD COME TO THIS

00:07:26.455 --> 00:07:29.091
SCHOOL AND SHOOT UP STONEMAN

00:07:28.891 --> 00:07:31.060
DOUGLAS.

00:07:29.224 --> 00:07:32.027
IT WAS LIKE A DREAM TO ME.

00:07:31.193 --> 00:07:33.862
I COULDN’T BELIEVE IT.

00:07:32.161 --> 00:07:34.730
I’M STILL IN SHOCK RIGHT NOW.

00:07:33.996 --> 00:07:36.232
&gt;&gt;  YEAH.

00:07:34.864 --> 00:07:37.466
I CAN’T IMAGINE HOW HARD THIS IS

00:07:36.365 --> 00:07:39.602
FOR BOTH OF YOU.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:41.237
BOTH OF YOU SHOWED AMAZING

00:07:39.735 --> 00:07:43.339
COURAGE TODAY UNDER THE MOST

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:46.042
DIFFICULT OF CIRCUMSTANCES.

00:07:43.472 --> 00:07:47.743
NO CHILD SHOULD HAVE TO SEE THAT

00:07:46.175 --> 00:07:50.212
EVER.

00:07:47.877 --> 00:07:50.513
MEGAN, MACKENZIE, THANK YOU

00:07:50.346 --> 00:07:52.181
BOTH.

00:07:50.646 --> 00:07:53.182
WE MISS YOU AND YOUR FAMILIES

00:07:52.315 --> 00:07:54.717
AND YOUR FRIENDS OBVIOUSLY,

00:07:53.316 --> 00:07:57.019
YOU’RE GOING TO HAVE A VERY

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:59.922
TOUGH WEEK AHEAD, AS THESE

00:07:57.153 --> 00:08:00.323
FAMILIES AND SCHOOL IS

